   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asociacion Grupo Integral de Mujeres Sanjuaneras</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AIMS is a local civil society organization in San Juan Sacatep&#xe9;quez, Guatemala. The project in Guatemala focuses on working with indigenous women, who, over the course of the project, strengthen their knowledge in violence prevention, environmental protection, and climate change. At the same time, the women&#x2019;s leadership is strengthened, with the goal that by the end of the project they actively exercise their leadership and participate in addressing the social, cultural, and environmental challenges they face. The project has a strong focus on political advocacy, with the target group developing and presenting proposals to local and national decision-makers.</narrative>
  </description>
